@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Runtime Tick
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Runtime Lock Intake" as Lock
rectangle "Substrate State Intake" as State
rectangle "Due Callback Selection" as Due
rectangle "Callback Plan Build" as Plan
rectangle "Dispatcher Handoff" as Dispatch

Lock --> Due : constrains callback selection for
State --> Due : supplies runtime triggers to
Due --> Plan : orders work into
Plan --> Dispatch : hands ordered work to
@enduml
